        <p class="text-[#8B7355] dark:text-[#B8A890] text-sm leading-relaxed">TofuPass is meant to be usable by real people in real situations. That includes people using keyboards, screen readers, zoom, high contrast settings, reduced motion, translation tools, touch devices, and other assistive technology.</p>
        <p class="text-[#8B7355] dark:text-[#B8A890] text-sm leading-relaxed mt-4">I am working toward WCAG 2.2 AA support while keeping TofuPass lightweight, private, and easy to use.</p>
      </section>

